:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) Copyright Quartz Systems 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 3'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CMDLIBL'.
:IMPORT NAME=ADDLIBLE PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGLIBL PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=CHGSYSLIBL PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=DSPLIBL PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=EDTLIBL PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:IMPORT NAME=RMVLIBLE PNLGRP=QHWMCMD.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS HELP=HLPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAJOR'.F16=Major menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CMDLIBL HELP=HLPCMDLIBL KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' PANELID=PANELID.Library List Commands
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?ADDLIBLE' HELP=ADDLIBLE.Add Library List Entry  ADDLIBLE
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?CHGLIBL' HELP=CHGLIBL.Change Library List  CHGLIBL
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?CHGSYSLIBL' HELP=CHGSYSLIBL.Change System Library List  CHGSYSLIBL
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD ?DSPLIBL' HELP=DSPLIBL.Display Library List  DSPLIBL
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD ?EDTLIBL' HELP=EDTLIBL.Edit Library List  EDTLIBL
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD ?RMVLIBLE' HELP=RMVLIBLE.Remove Library List Entry  RMVLIBLE
:EMENUGRP.
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCMDLIBL.Library List Commands - Help
:P.Library List Commands: every command whose name carries LIBL after its verb, in name order, with the command name at the right of its row. The option numbers follow the full command set of the systems this one is compatible with, so a blank row is a command this release does not provide.
:P.Type an option number and press Enter to prompt the command, or type a command on the command line. F12 returns to the previous menu, F3 to the menu where you started and F16 to the major command groups.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPKEYS.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F1=Help
:PD.Shows help for the item the cursor is on; on the title, help for the whole menu.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Leaves the menu and the menus it was reached from.
:PT.F4=Prompt
:PD.Prompts the command on the command line, or the command of the option typed.
:PT.F9=Retrieve
:PD.Puts the last command run back on the command line; press it again for the one before.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous menu.
:PT.F16=Major menu
:PD.Shows that menu.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
